msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「......Yes?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Sí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's me. We need to talk.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Soy yo. Tenemos que hablar.」"

msgid "Taiga「......About?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿De qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Will you let me in?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Me dejas entrar?」"

msgid "Taiga「........................」"
msgstr "Taiga「........................」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......*Sigh*」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......*Suspiro*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No...... It's too early for me to be feeling＿relieved......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No...... Aún es pronto para＿sentir alivio......）」"

msgid "Taiga「......How's the scarf?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué tal la bufanda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh...... well, it suits me just fine. Quite＿comfortable.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehh...... bueno, me queda＿muy bien. Es muy cómoda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh...... that's good.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah...... qué bueno.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, so then I realized. It's the same＿as the smell of your hair, Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, y entonces me di cuenta. Huele＿igual que tu cabello, Taiga.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You used it regularly, and we soaked it＿in your conditioner, so I suppose it's＿only natural......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La usabas seguido y la remojamos＿en tu acondicionador, así que supongo＿que es normal......」"

msgid "Taiga「Hang on a second, Ryuuji. Not that I＿believe it, but you're not telling me＿you've gone into heat, are you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Un momento, Ryuuji. No es que lo＿crea, pero no me estarás diciendo＿que entraste en celo, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh gross, now I need brain bleach!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Qué asco, necesito borrarme＿eso de la cabeza!」"

msgid "Taiga「What is it?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's about Christmas Eve.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es sobre Nochebuena.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That night, I ran to school because you＿told me to, so I could meet Kushieda＿and confess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esa noche corrí a la escuela＿porque me lo dijiste, para ver＿a Kushieda y confesarme.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Enough, just hear me all the way out,＿please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Basta, solo escúchame hasta＿el final, por favor.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Taiga「......What, so you went out of your way＿to come here to say that?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Qué? ¿Viniste hasta aquí＿solo para decirme eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not all, but for now, well, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es todo, pero por ahora, bueno, sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「What are you gonna do......? Gonna＿confess to her properly this time?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué vas a hacer......? ¿Esta vez sí＿vas a confesarte como se debe?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You're wrong. That's not it...... I'm going＿to get rejected.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te equivocas. No es eso......＿Voy a hacer que me rechace.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Huh? What the hell? I REALLY don't＿get what you mean.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Eh? ¿Qué rayos? De verdad＿NO entiendo qué quieres decir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, since my feelings haven't caught＿up, I don't have any, so this will just be＿for appearance's sake.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, mis sentimientos no han＿vuelto. No siento nada, así que＿solo será una formalidad.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But just because the feelings are gone＿doesn't mean it didn't happen, right?＿So I'm going to reject the past me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero que ya no lo sienta no borra＿lo que pasó, ¿no? Así que voy a rechazar＿a mi yo del pasado.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Besides, she didn't even let me spit it＿out last time. This time I'll get the＿words out and get properly rejected.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Además, la otra vez ni me dejó decirlo.＿Esta vez lo diré y haré que me rechace＿como se debe.」"

msgid "Taiga「Why......? That's putting Minorin＿through a lot!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué......? ¡Eso es＿muy duro para Minorin!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's okay. I made sure to get her＿consent.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pasa nada. Me aseguré＿de que aceptara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「To be at your side, that's why!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Para estar a tu lado, por eso!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha......? Huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qu......? ¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Tigers and dragons are equals,＿obviously.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Los tigres y los dragones＿son iguales, obviamente.」"

msgid "Taiga「......W-Why are you bringing this up＿now!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡¿P-Por qué sales con eso ahora?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now it's my turn. Putting an end to our＿united front...... If I can't become a＿dragon, I can't be equal to you, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora me toca a mí. Terminar nuestra＿alianza...... Si no me vuelvo un dragón,＿no seré tu igual, ¿no?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's why I'm going. I'll go, get＿rejected, and come back! Back here!!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Por eso voy. ¡Iré, me rechazarán＿y volveré! ¡¡Volveré aquí!!」"

msgid "Taiga「You won't be rejected...... As if she＿would!」"
msgstr "Taiga「No te va a rechazar...... ¡Como＿si fuera a hacerlo!」"

msgid "Taiga「Ask her out! Make her say yes! Get the＿hell out of my sight!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Pídele que salga contigo! ¡Haz que＿acepte! ¡¡Lárgate de mi vista!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera!」"

msgid "Taiga「W-What are you doing!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Q-Qué haces?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't thrash around or you'll choke.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te muevas tanto o te ahogarás.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'll come back, so wait here. Okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Volveré, así que espera aquí. ¿Sí?」"

msgid "Taiga「I don't care.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No me importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright. Be right back.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Muy bien. Vuelvo enseguida.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Shut it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Cállate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Behave yourself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pórtate bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's got this nice smell that calms me＿down somehow. It's somewhat＿nostalgic and gives me peace of」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tiene un olor agradable que me＿calma. Me trae recuerdos y me da paz」"

msgid "Ryuuji「mind......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「mental......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Don't interrupt me when I'm trying＿to say something important...... Good＿grief. Fine, I'll make it quick, so let me」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......No me interrumpas cuando＿digo algo importante...... Cielos. Seré＿breve, pero déjame」"

msgid "Ryuuji「finish.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「terminar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But even under the pretext of \"a＿present you coordinated for me,\" I＿think in the end it was just the faithful」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero aun con la excusa de \"un＿regalo que me preparaste\", creo＿que solo fui el fiel」"

msgid "Ryuuji「dog following his owner's command.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「perro que obedece las＿órdenes de su dueña.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So yeah. After this, I think I should go＿see Kushieda of my own volition. I＿haven't talked to her about it and she's」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que sí. Creo que debo ir a ver＿a Kushieda por voluntad propia. No＿lo hablé con ella y está」"

msgid "Ryuuji「probably at practice, so I think I'll＿swing by the school.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「probablemente entrenando, así que＿creo que pasaré por la escuela.」"

msgid "Taiga「Aha! In that case, it should work out＿this time for sure. I talked to her＿yesterday and confirmed that she had」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ajá! En ese caso, esta vez seguro＿saldrá bien. Ayer hablé con ella＿y confirmé que tenía」"

msgid "Taiga「no reason to reject you. Third time＿really is the charm! Go for it, Ryuuji!」"
msgstr "Taiga「cero motivos para rechazarte.＿¡La tercera es la vencida!＿¡Adelante, Ryuuji!」"

msgid "Taiga「Even STILL! You can't do that! It's too＿selfish! If you confess, you'll be able to＿win her heart! Why would you go get」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡AUN ASÍ! ¡No puedes! ¡Es egoísta!＿¡Si te confiesas, podrás conquistarla!＿¡¿Por qué buscas que te」"

msgid "Taiga「rejected on purpose!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「rechace a propósito?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「By spring of last year, you were＿already one damn step ahead. Even＿though you shot Kitamura down, I」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「La primavera pasada ya me llevabas＿un paso de ventaja. Aunque rechazaste＿a Kitamura, yo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「thought you were amazing...... I mean it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「pensé que eras increíble......＿¡Lo digo en serio!」"
